docs {
  # Proposal API
  
  Endpoints untuk manajemen proposal (HakiProposal) - create, invite, respond, review.
  
  **Base URL:** `/api/proposal`
  
  ---
  
  ## Endpoints
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Role |
  |--------|----------|-------------|------|------|
  | POST | `/` | Buat proposal baru | ✅ | Dosen, Mahasiswa |
  | POST | `/:proposalId/invite` | Undang anggota | ✅ | Dosen, Mahasiswa (Ketua) |
  | POST | `/:proposalId/respond` | Respon undangan | ✅ | Dosen, Mahasiswa |
  | POST | `/:proposalId/review` | Admin review proposal | ✅ | Admin |
  
  ---
  
  ## Data Model
  
  ```typescript
  interface HakiProposal {
    id: string;           // UUID
    judul: string;        // Judul proposal
    file_url: string | null; // URL file proposal
    status_usulan: string; // Status review
    createdAt: string;    // ISO timestamp
    updatedAt: string;    // ISO timestamp
  }
  
  interface MemberProposal {
    id: string;
    haki_proposal_id: string;
    user_id: string;
    peran: 'Ketua' | 'Anggota';
    status_invite: 'pending' | 'Accepted' | 'Rejected';
  }
  ```
}
